    "handle": "lazarat-griffon-diving-200",
    "title": "Lazarat Griffon PoP 200",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Lazara Griffon Pop is a floating popper.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Keep the rod tip low, and with a short jerk, the lure creates a plop and dives just below the surface. If you continue retrieving at this point, either by moving the rod tip or reeling in, the Griffon Pop will walk side to side just beneath the surface leaving bubble trail behind. You can also work it aggressively with strong swipes, and it will create more noise.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The Griffon is a slim-style wooden floating lure series, featuring smallmouth poppers and diving poppers in various sizes. It offers long, stable casting, is easy to use, and highly durable. Built with a 2mm stainless steel through-body construction and coated with six layers of premium-quality epoxy for maximum durability.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Rigging option:</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Hooks: Bkk lone diablo 9/0 or Bkk raptor z 4/0 (weight 7-9g)&nbsp;</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Length 200 mm</span></p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Gr. 100</span></p></li></ul>",
